{"id":"wb-6-656","name":"太康文庙","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"太康文庙","text":"太康文庙位于中华人民共和国河南省周口市太康县北大街路西，又称太康黉学。太康文庙始建于明宣德元年（1426年），原有泮池、棂星门、戟门、拜殿、大成殿、崇圣祠等建筑，崇祯年间毁于兵燹，清顺治、康熙年间多次修缮。2006年被公布为第六批全国重点文物保护单位。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%A4%AA%E5%BA%B7%E6%96%87%E5%BA%99","revisionId":86946530,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=86946530","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/1aa3a008350ca9f4fc4c892e.jpg","title":"20240806_Taikang_Confucian_Temple_06.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:20240806_Taikang_Confucian_Temple_06.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/8/82/20240806_Taikang_Confucian_Temple_06.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Windmemories","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​太康文庙，第六批全国重点文物保护单位","width":320,"height":213}}